   "type": "file",
   "name": "knowledge_tools.py",
   "filePath": "langgraph/tools/knowledge_tools.py",
   "summary": "Knowledge Tools - Knowledge MCP Server 调用封装 通过 MCP 协议（JSON-RPC over HTTP POST /mcp, Streamable HTTP）调用 mcp-knowledge 服务（settings.MCP_KNOWLEDGE_URL, 默认 :8200）， 提供知识检索、实体/关系查询等能力。对上层 Agent / Node 隐藏 MCP",
